绿色缎面短裙替换为<image2>中四格共同展示的同款服装——浅薄荷绿色露肩长裙：该裙肩部与手臂外覆轻盈半透明薄纱披层，背部为交叉系带设计，下摆是多层飘逸的半透明薄纱裙摆。将裙子穿着到<image1>人物的身体轮廓上：露肩领口对齐其锁骨下方并自然露出双肩，胸腰剪裁贴合其自然腰线，薄纱裙摆顺应当前站姿垂直下垂至脚踝上方，使金色高跟凉鞋保持可见；半透明薄纱的褶皱与垂坠跟随<image1>人物当前的站立姿势和手臂微张姿态产生自然形变。同时去除<image1>中的灰色幕布背景和灰色地面，将背景替换为<image3>中的花园场景：前景绿色草坪、两侧紫色绣球花丛与粉色玫瑰花丛、右后方白色石质栏杆台阶。人物双脚稳稳站在草坪上，脚下生成与花园柔和自然日光方向一致的接触阴影；人物肤色与服装整体色温适配<image3>户外散射日光环境，边缘过渡自然无抠图痕迹。保持<image1>中人物的面部特征、长直黑发型、金色耳环和项链、站姿以及高跟凉鞋完全不变。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 770, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 499, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "positive", "links": [740], "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "negative", "links": [741], "label": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "negative"}, {"name": "latent", "links": [742], "label": "latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent"}], "size": [541.9922485351562, 610.7180786132812], "pos": [46.406715393066406, 2403.495361328125], "widgets_values": ["The image is a wide hand-drawn charcoal sketch portrait of a young East Asian woman rendered in a rough ink-and-charcoal illustration style, set against a textured off-white paper background with subtle grain and faint tonal variation across its surface. The background is a flat, unbleached cream paper with visible fibre texture, slightly darker at the edges suggesting a scanned or photographed sheet. In the upper-left quadrant, a large handwritten brush-script headline reads \"Still Here\" in thick black strokes, the letters loose and expressive with uneven weight, the word \"Still\" stacked above \"Here\" and a short horizontal dash beneath. Directly below that headline, two lines of small black serif type read \"Same me.\" and \"A quieter day.\" in a lighter, more restrained weight than the brush-script above. The central subject occupies the middle and lower half of the frame: a young woman depicted from the shoulders up, her face turned slightly toward the viewer with a calm, neutral expression. Her hair is rendered in dense, heavy charcoal strokes, long and dark, falling past her shoulders on both sides and parted near the centre of her head, with the texture of individual strokes visible throughout. Her face is left mostly unshaded, the paper white showing through for skin, while her eyes are drawn as small dark ovals with defined brows above them, and her lips are a small dark mark. On the upper-left of her head, a small butterfly-shaped hair clip is suggested with a few delicate lines, echoing the accessory in the source photograph. She wears a scoop-neck top rendered in rough cross-hatched charcoal, the leopard-print pattern suggested through irregular dark spots and patches rather than detailed rendering, the neckline curving low across her chest. A thin gold necklace with a small round pendant hangs at her collarbone, drawn as a fine single line with a tiny circle at its centre. On the right side of the frame, roughly at mid-height, a small black serif label reads \"NO. 01\" with a thin horizontal rule drawn directly beneath it. Below that, in the lower-right area, three short lines of small black serif type read \"Some faces\" \"carry\" \"silent stories.\" stacked vertically with generous leading. The lighting is flat and even across the entire composition, with no cast shadows or highlights, consistent with a hand-drawn illustration on a paper surface where all depth comes from line weight and stroke density rather than light direction. The overall composition is balanced and minimalist, with the dense dark charcoal mass of the figure anchoring the centre while the sparse text elements float in the negative space on either side, creating a quiet, contemplative mood on a restrained palette of black ink on cream paper.", "", 1024], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 